WEBVTT

00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:02.616
Sophie's five years old
and lives with her parents.

00:01:03.982 --> 00:01:06.324
One day, there's a bang at the door.

00:01:06.348 --> 00:01:09.133
Sophie hears lots of shouting;
her mum's crying.

00:01:09.157 --> 00:01:12.232
She sees the police
dragging her father away.

00:01:12.256 --> 00:01:14.923
Sophie's afraid. She starts crying, too.

00:01:15.574 --> 00:01:17.089
Weeks go by.

00:01:17.113 --> 00:01:19.764
Sophie doesn't know
what's happened to her dad.

00:01:19.788 --> 00:01:21.960
When she asks her mum, her mum gets upset.

00:01:21.984 --> 00:01:23.775
So she stops asking.

00:01:25.307 --> 00:01:26.648
Sophie waits.

00:01:27.331 --> 00:01:29.065
She really misses her dad.

00:01:29.836 --> 00:01:32.947
Every day, she hurries home from school,
in case he's come back.